  rank `r+1` with shape `[I, J, ..., L, M, num_rows, num_cols]` when only one
  diagonal is given (`k` is an integer or `k[0] == k[1]`). Otherwise, it has rank
  `r` with shape `[I, J, ..., L, num_rows, num_cols]`.

